<title>GERMANY: Depfa says Q1 oper profits before provs up.</title>
<headline>Depfa says Q1 oper profits before provs up.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group oper profit before provisions   167    up 11 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German bank is Deutsche Pfandbrief- und Hypothekenbank AG, a leading issuer of Pfandbrief mortgage bonds.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
